  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d3a3ac72-2909-46be-8a00-48c07ab0faf5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"164\"></p>\n<h3><strong>關於此模組</strong></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>這個模組為 Minecraft 新增了數艘可愛的新船。讓這些可愛的船隻為你的遊戲增添風采，盡情享受優雅航行於大海的樂趣吧！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_68726618-4040-4a73-91da-6adad9ae7985.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"201\"></p>",
